# Phase-structure check: Tripathi, Rai, Tiwari, arXiv:2512.13398 (2025), Table II (QM parameters) and Table III (s-MFA rows QM, Log PQM; m_sigma = 500)

Standard mean field (no-sea) QM and Log PQM rows only; RQM/RPQM (on-shell renormalized vacuum term), PolyLog-glue and vector interactions = features. Log potential RRW (as solver), T0 = 187 MeV (paper Sec. II B). Phi, Phibar independent reals minimizing the real part (paper Sec. II B) = PQM_indep. Physical point g = 6.5 (Rai 2023). Chiral-limit rows (m_pi = 0, f_pi = 90.67): g not stated -> run with g = 6.5 and with g = 2*300.3/90.67 = 6.624.

